== Effects ==
* Isaac fires 4 tears at the same time.
* {{Dlc|nr}} Tears down: (Delay * 2.1) + 3.
* {{Dlc|r}} Tears fired per second * 0.42.
* {{transformation contribution|Spider Baby}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Mutant Spider is a [[special item]].
* {{dlc+|a}} The maximum number of tears per volley that can be reached by combining and/or duplicating {{i|20/20}}, {{i|The Inner Eye}}, Mutant Spider and {{i|The Wiz}} is 16.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|a+nr}} {{i|20/20}}: Shoots 6 tears.
** {{dlc|r}} Removes the fire rate penalty while reducing damage to 80%. Additional copies will add one additional tear with no further change to damage/fire rate.
* {{I|Abyss}}: When Isaac uses Abyss to absorb Mutant Spider it creates four locusts instead of one.
* {{I|Brimstone}}: Shoots 4 beams at once.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Cursed Eye}}: Shoots 4 shots out of each eye, for a total of 16 tears when fully charged.
* {{i|Doctor's Remote}}/{{i|Epic Fetus}}: Replaces the single missile strike with a barrage of four consecutive missiles.
* {{dlc|anr}} {{i|The Inner Eye}}: Shoots 7 tears with no further decrease in fire rate.
** {{dlc|r}} Shoots 5 tears with no further decrease in fire rate.
* {{i|Libra}}: Negates the firing rate reduction effect.
* {{I|Monstro's Lung}}: Adds 7 tears to the barrage with a significant decrease in fire rate.
* {{dlc|anr}}{{i|Mutant Spider}}: Fires 8 tears with no further decrease in fire rate.
** {{dlc|r}} Each copy of the item adds +2 tears, up to the maximum of 16.
* {{i|Polyphemus}}: Tear rate is not lowered further. Damage is increased by a flat +5 instead of normal Polyphemus boost.
* {{i|Tractor Beam}}: All tears are fired along the beam.
* {{i|The Wiz|nr}}: Four shots are fired in each direction.
** {{dlc|r}}: Three shots are fired in each direction.

== Interactions ==
* {{Dlc|na+}} {{i|20/20}}: Overridden by Mutant Spider.
* {{C|Keeper|n}}: Fires {{dlc|nr}} 7 / {{dlc|r}} 5 tears with significantly decreased fire rate.
* {{c|Tainted Keeper}}: Fires 6 tears with significantly decreased fire rate.
* {{I|The Ludovico Technique}}: The tear gains 3 orbiting tears.
* {{i|Loki's Horns}}: Only occasionally fires one tear in the other three directions.
* {{Dlc|na+}} {{i|Mom's Eye}}: No effect.
** {{dlc|a+}} Fires three shots out of each eye.
* {{i|Pupula Duplex|a+}} + {{i|Lachryphagy|n}}: The four shots instantly fuse and burst.
* {{i|Sad Bombs}} / {{I|Varicose Veins}} / {{I|It Hurts}}: No effect.

